":2,"impression_count":6577,"like_count":37,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"西安交大原校长王树国\n担任福耀科技大学校长，年薪500万。\n\n骂的人不少，可我觉得这钱花得明白：\n曹德旺是生意人，花500万请一个校长，付得起\n\n公办大学的校长拿得少，可落马的一个接一个\n明面上的工资不多，暗地里的“收入”谁也算不清。\n\n500万摆在桌面上，起码干净。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114856786314281068"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114854594605940993"],"id":"2114854594605940993","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":47,"impression_count":55810,"like_count":202,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":17},"text":"中国广义财政支出连跌七个月，财政紧缩持续拖累内需\n\n10月24日，彭博社报道，中国9月广义财政支出同比下降3.7%，连续第七个月萎缩，降幅虽较8月的6.7%有所收窄，但财政紧缩态势未见根本改善。 https://t.co/A7nu3eaa6N","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114854594605940993"},{"author_id":"8149482","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:56:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114853693077995584"],"id":"2114853693077995584","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":14313,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":2},"text":"代表劳工党的巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦(Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva)在竞争激烈的决选中胜出，成功赢得第四个任期；这一结果在国内和国际上引发了截然不同的反应。\nhttps://t.co/pQRHwEIe7X","url":"https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2114853693077995584"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:52:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114852746650132509"],"id":"2114852746650132509","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7066,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"24号，张雪见到易军，还是很尊敬地称为“易老师”，并且主动跟他握手。\n\n毕竟易军是当年跟拍张雪的记者，年龄也比张雪大👍\n\n25号，张雪挑战“吉尼斯纪录”成功之后\n\n张雪笑着说:“啊，是小易呀”\n\n​24个小时，从易老师到小易\n是他们之间感情亲密了，还是张雪盛气凌人了？","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114852746650132509"},{"author_id":"1072109417200414720","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:47:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114851320691916821"],"id":"2114851320691916821","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":97,"impression_count":253926,"like_count":384,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":68,"retweet_count":25},"text":"徽剑被杀害的判决书，哪位手里有，欢迎给王局提供投稿：\n\nwangjuBGSH@gmail.com\n\n感谢感谢🙏 https://t.co/UXEg0Mq1sb","url":"https://x.com/wangzhian8848/status/2114851320691916821"},{"author_id":"20845447","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:45:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114850905942331404"],"id":"2114850905942331404","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6278,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"微软推出自愿离职方案，涉及约6万名员工 rfi.​my/DAHm https://t.co/ayfxog1VDl","url":"https://x.com/RFI_Cn/status/2114850905942331404"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114849553773940930"],"id":"2114849553773940930","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":160,"impression_count":161705,"like_count":1055,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":87,"retweet_count":43},"text":"“起承转美”\n10月25日，一名网友分享自己在广东打车经历。由于导航定位错误，她与朋友走错上车点，耽误了司机的时间。上车后，司机开始破口大骂、不停抱怨，称交通堵塞、交通规划、人多、和顾客互骂被取消订单。\n网友《起承转美》计上心头，司机还在滔滔不绝，网友见缝插针，说：“都怪美，美太坏了。” https://t.co/G1tvhy9Jho","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114849553773940930"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:39:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114849515966505400"],"id":"2114849515966505400","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6153,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刘涛上海遭遇咸猪手！\n\n刘涛在上海参加活动，被意大利顶级奢侈品牌Brunello Cucinelli 创始人 ，紧抓手臂不放，还“袭胸”！\n\n刘涛不敢甩手，不敢冷脸，连皱个眉都不敢。\n\n什么上流社交活动，尽是下流龌龊之举👎","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114849515966505400"},{"author_id":"187428824","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:23:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114845281254588449"],"id":"2114845281254588449","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1901,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":4},"text":"\"10月18日，位于江西省萍乡市开发区的两处家庭教会聚会点突然遭到联合执法。约40名武装警察带走了包括 #丁兴安 在内的27名教徒。\n\n消息指，当局此次实施拘捕的罪名为“偷越国边境罪”，原因与丁兴安等人在今年前往印度尼西亚参加为期七天的神学培训课程有关。\" (对华援助协会)\n\nhttps://t.co/dpQq9aTsWl https://t.co/7S6DU4MiyF","url":"https://x.com/hrw_chinese/status/2114845281254588449"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:21:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114844786557612111"],"id":"2114844786557612111","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":6321,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":1},"text":"出道题：九万块社保，交还是不交？\n\n一个59岁的农民工，在工地干了一辈子：瓦工、木工、刷油漆，挣一天吃一天，从没交过社保。\n\n儿子小时候问他老了有没有退休金，他说：“有，我养儿防老。”\n\n现在村长挨家挨户上门通知：能补缴社保，九万，一次交齐，60岁以后每月领一千来块。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114844786557612111"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114844520579735713"],"id":"2114844520579735713","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":56411,"like_count":147,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":8},"text":"蔡康永出席蒋万安竞选总部成立大会\n\n10月26日，台湾媒体报道，台湾艺人蔡康永出席国民党台北市长候选人蒋万安的竞选总部成立大会。 \n因其此前曾现身民进党候选人沈伯洋的活动，此举再度引发两岸热议。 https://t.co/SL5NiJg5tF https://t.co/frYrBaZe0g","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114844520579735713"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:19:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114844329584001067"],"id":"2114844329584001067","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":16538,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"加州大学很早就禁止录取照顾捐款人、教师、校友子女，所有人一视同仁采取同一标准。但州政府管不了私立大学，只能立法规定如果私立大学照顾捐款人、教师、校友子女，州政府就不给资助。于是斯坦福宣布放弃州政府的资助，因为州政府给的资助还不如他们搞一笔私人捐赠。加州理工倒是因此不再搞录取照顾了","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114844329584001067"},{"author_id":"98864871","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:08:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114841739651670195"],"id":"2114841739651670195","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6765,"like_count":54,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"24日我发文，以三项权益为前提，征求X账号的订阅者。到现在48小时，订阅者从18人增长到40人。\n\n在此，向新加入的22位支持者表示感谢。当然，也要感谢一直以来的18位支持者—-感觉你们如同十八罗汉一般加持了我很久😂 https://t.co/VPwJWQYXLN","url":"https://x.com/wangdan1989/status/2114841739651670195"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:05:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114840970474987768"],"id":"2114840970474987768","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":13502,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"你父母、祖父母是高官，也可以去读清华。你怎么不闹革命？何况清华是公立学校，哈佛是私立学校，有可比性吗？怎么不跟加州大学比？ https://t.co/kQ3kcBmLmY","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114840970474987768"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:01:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114839915792150950"],"id":"2114839915792150950","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4572,"like_count":30,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你告诉傻子，他被骗了\n傻子不恨骗子，恨你\n\n因为骗子骗的是他的智商\n你戳破的是他的脸\n\n中推圈，天天上演。😂","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114839915792150950"},{"author_id":"8149482","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:00:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114839612103241750"],"id":"2114839612103241750","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":11735,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":5},"text":"塞尔维亚多数选民星期日(10月25日)投票支持由学生领导的反对派运动所推举的候选人，从而终结了长期领导人亚历山大·武契奇(Aleksandar Vucic)的统治。\nhttps://t.co/br5eivIGRY","url":"https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2114839612103241750"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:00:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114839494776238174"],"id":"2114839494776238174","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":111,"impression_count":109906,"like_count":732,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":60,"retweet_count":111},"text":"越南警方：电诈团伙包下整座酒店，约定不骗越南人，74名中国人被抓\n\n10月25日，越南公安部披露，一个由中国人主导的跨国电诈团伙包下清化省整座酒店，将设备和数据从柬埔寨运来，并约定不以越南人为诈骗目标，以增加当地警方发现、查办的难度。 https://t.co/mSRsB5JIJx","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114839494776238174"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T21:48:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114836657492951514"],"id":"2114836657492951514","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":6223,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"高校老师们，恭喜。\n工资还没涨，钱先换了个“智能笼子”。\n\n♦️多所高校将通过数字人民币发工资\n\n数字人民币实名钱包开启计息，\n和活期存款规则一致，\n还纳入存款保险保障。\n资金依旧留在银行体系内，\n不会造成存款流失，\n反而提升大家使用意愿。\n不少高校试点用它发放工资，\n结算高效、可追溯，","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114836657492951514"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-26T21:45:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114835845593321979"],"id":"2114835845593321979","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":12957,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"川普在密歇根演讲：“坦白说，挪威糟透了。说真的，挪威已经变成了一个粪坑国家。我结束了8场战争，即将再结束两场。我阻止了伊朗搞核武器。但是我没拿到诺贝尔奖。所以我不想让任何挪威人过来。我不想跟挪威有任何瓜葛。”2025年有1005名挪威人移民美国，有1529名美国人移民挪威。","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114835845593321979"},{"author_id":"1239457591417171973","created_at":"2026-10-26T21:45:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114835793176821772"],"id":"2114835793176821772","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":18249,"like_count":82,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"坐等这个B站up主醒来后改名😁😁\n\n#姆巴佩辱华 https://t.co/tlbrFh9ovL","url":"https://x.com/GFWfrog/status/2114835793176821772"},{"author_id":"20845447","created_at":"2026-10-26T21:40:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114834483547681074"],"id":"2114834483547681074","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3715,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"以在希伯伦的军事行动：联合国警告存在“种族清洗”风险 rfi.​my/DAHP https://t.co/rLo5nazZwz","url":"https://x.com/RFI_Cn/status/2114834483547681074"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1154174763918606339","name":"猫神","username":"maoshen"},{"id":"232201624","name":"方舟子","username":"fangshimin"},{"id":"